        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5165 Lever With 5032 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe simple design of this Baldwin made Tube Lever makes it as versatile as it is high quality. A limited lifetime mechanical warranty assures that it lives up to the high standards that Baldwin is known for.  The 5165 lever with the 5032 rosette will fit 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". 5032 rosette diameter is 2-1/8\"  and <b>will NOT cover standard 2-1/8\" bore</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5161 Contemporary Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Modern Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5032 Rose Diameter: 2-1/8\" - <b>will not cover standard 2-1/8\" bore</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.58\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<!-- <li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button located on rosette. An emergency release function allows the lever to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Half Dummy function is handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other lever functions are non-handed.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simple Solid Brass Interior Lever, Baldwin 5165",
                "description": "Baldwin Estate Collection 5165 Lever with 5032 Rose - The simple design of this Baldwin made Tube Lever makes it as versatile as it is high quality. A limited lifetime mechanical warranty assures that it lives up to the high standards that Baldwin is known for. The 5165 lever with the 5032 rosette will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "BAL-5165, Baldwin Tubular leversets, baldwin 5165 levers, baldwin 5032 roses, baldwin 5032 roses, solid brass leversets, contemporary levers, contemporary levesets, baldwin 5165 leversets, baldwin 5032 rosettes, baldwin estates collections, ada compliant levers, Simple Solid Brass Interior Levers,"
